        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>NGP 410-72, 2-1/2 x 1/4 x 72 Smooth Saddle Threshold</b>\r\n<p>\r\n2-1/2\" wide x 1/4\" high x 72\" length aluminum ADA compliant smooth surface saddle threshold.  These 72 inch long smooth thresholds are made from non rusting T5 aluminum alloy and used for filling the gap between the door bottom and floor. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with #10 flat head zinc plated wood screws. Smooth surface top with typical wall thickness of .125\". Cross reference to Pemko 173A Saddle Threshold.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/2-1-2-x-1-4-x-36-smooth-saddle-threshold-ngp-410-36\"><b>NGP 410-36  2-1/2 x 1/4 x 36 Saddle Threshold</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for NGP 410-72 72\" Saddle Threshold\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 72\" (6 feet)</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Thickness: .125 (1/8\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: T5 aluminum alloy</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Mill Finish Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Installation Screws: #10 x 1-1/2\" FH Zinc Plated Wood Screws</li>\r\n<li><b>ADA Compliant</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/410_cutsheet.pdf?v=1704262397\" target=\"new\"><b>NGP 410 Cutsheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAvailable in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish.\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
